  "name": {
    "en": "Thonglor and Ekkamai"
  },
  "tagline": {
    "en": "Bangkok’s trendiest bars and restaurants, pricier, less walkable."
  },
  "about": {
    "en": "Thong Lo (Sukhumvit Soi 55) and Ekkamai (Soi 63) are two long sois that run north from the BTS, and they hold the city's most fashionable bars, restaurants and cafes. Distances are longer than they look on a map, so plan on taxis or motorbike taxis up the soi. Phra Khanong, the next stop east, is the cheaper, more local end. Pick this area for nights out and good coffee, not for sightseeing."
  },
